return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:35+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:35+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'将此 WordPress 站点连接到 Zinn Digital®，以便向其发布定时文章。粘贴来自您 Zinn® 仪表盘的配对码，插件便会自动设置其自身凭据——无需手动复制任何内容。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'已保存。请输入新值进行替换。','Filter this list…'=>'筛选此列表…','Filter this list'=>'筛选此列表','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'没有与该筛选条件匹配的项目。','Add a row'=>'添加行','Remove this row'=>'移除此行','Remove'=>'移除','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — 概览','Overview'=>'概览','Copied'=>'已复制','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'此站点上的每个 Zinn® 插件，以及它是否正常工作。','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'此插件不需要任何连接。','Open settings'=>'打开设置','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','Settings sections'=>'设置部分','Support'=>'支持','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Tools'=>'工具','Export settings'=>'导出设置','Reset to defaults'=>'恢复默认值','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'这将把此插件的每项设置恢复为默认值。您要继续吗？','Diagnostics for support'=>'支持诊断信息','Import a settings file'=>'导入设置文件','Import'=>'导入','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'导出的文件绝不包含密码、令牌或 API 密钥——您需要在新站点上重新输入这些内容。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'该插件的所有设置均已恢复为默认值。','Done.'=>'完成。','That action is not available.'=>'该操作不可用。','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'无法读取该文件。请选择从 Zinn® 插件导出的设置文件。','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'该文件过大，不像是导出的设置文件。','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'该文件不是 Zinn® 设置导出文件。','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'该文件是从其他插件（%s）导出的，因此在此处导入它将存储此插件无法理解的设置。','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'已导入 %d 个设置。密码和 API 密钥绝不会包含在导出文件中，因此请重新输入这些内容。','The archive would be %1$d MB, over the %2$d MB limit set on this site. Raise the limit, or exclude some folders, on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups screen.'=>'归档大小将达到 %1$d MB，已超过本站点设置的 %2$d MB 限制。请在“Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups”屏幕中调高限制，或排除部分文件夹。','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'该站点的 PHP 无法创建归档文件，因此未能生成备份。','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'无法创建临时文件。','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'无法归档该站点文件。','This site\'s PHP cannot compress archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'此站点的 PHP 无法压缩归档文件，因此无法创建备份。','A backup of this site needs about %1$s of temporary space and only %2$s is free, so it was not attempted.'=>'备份此站点大约需要 %1$s 的临时空间，而目前仅有 %2$s 可用空间，因此未尝试进行备份。','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'此 WordPress 用户无法发布文章，因此现在建立的连接也无法发布。请以具有相应权限的用户身份登录，然后重试。','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'此站点已禁用应用程序密码，因此我们无法创建凭据。请要求您的主机提供商启用它们，或者使用您在 Zinn Digital® 控制面板中自行创建的密码连接该站点。','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress 无法为此站点创建凭据。尚未向任何位置发送任何内容。','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'我们无法从此站点访问 Zinn Digital®。未连接任何内容，我们创建的凭据也已被移除。请检查站点是否可以发送外发请求，然后重试。','Zinn Digital® could not finish connecting this site. The problem is on our side, not with your pairing code — nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. The same pairing code still works: try again in a few minutes.'=>'Zinn Digital® 无法完成此站点的连接。问题出在我们这边，而不是您的配对码 — 没有任何内容被连接，并且我们创建的凭据已被删除。同一个配对码仍然有效：请在几分钟后重试。','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® 未接受该配对代码。未连接任何内容。请在您的仪表盘中生成一个新代码并重试。','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'已连接。Zinn Digital® 现在可以发布到此站点。','Connected'=>'已连接','Connecting…'=>'正在连接…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'已连接，但需要注意某些事项','Not connected'=>'未连接','Running on your own account'=>'在您自己的账户上运行','We could not check this'=>'我们无法检查此项','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'此插件未说明原因。请发送诊断报告，我们将进行查看。','Connection status'=>'连接状态','Last checked %s ago.'=>'上次检查于 %s 前。','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(在新标签页中打开)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'将此发送给 Zinn® 支持团队','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'发送的内容完全就是这些——没有其他内容，也没有隐藏任何信息。您的密码、令牌和 API 密钥均不包含在内。','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'将要发送的诊断报告','Copy to clipboard'=>'复制到剪贴板','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'将此报告发送给 Zinn® 支持团队','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'我们会为您创建支持工单并通过电子邮件回复。如果您不希望发送，请复制上方内容并自行粘贴到工单中。','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'我们无法从此服务器（%s）连接到 Zinn Digital®。请复制上方的报告并提交工单 — 您的设置没有任何问题。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'已发送。Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告，并将通过电子邮件回复。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'已发送。Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告 — 参考编号 %s — 并将通过电子邮件回复。','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'您在短时间内发送了多份报告。请等待几分钟后再试 — 先前的报告已经送达。','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® 刚才无法接收报告——这是我们这边的问题，不是您的问题。请稍后重试，或将上述报告复制到工单中。','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'报告已被拒绝（HTTP %d）。请复制上文并提交工单，同时附上该编号。','This site’s owner has turned off image uploads for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'此站点的所有者已在 Zinn® Connector 设置中为 Zinn Digital® 关闭了图片上传功能。','This site’s owner has turned off edits to existing articles for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'该站点的所有者已在 Zinn® Connector 设置中关闭了对 Zinn Digital® 现有文章的编辑。','New article on your site: %s'=>'您网站上的新文章：%s','Zinn Digital® has added an article to your site.

Title: %1$s
Edit it: %2$s
Status: %3$s

Turn these emails off on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing screen.'=>'Zinn Digital® 已在您的网站中添加了一篇文章。

标题：%1$s
编辑文章：%2$s
状态：%3$s

请在 Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing 页面关闭此类电子邮件。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南和服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读 %s 用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'用于 WordPress 的 Zinn® 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移，以及专为管理多个网站的人群打造的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖成熟网站、域名及外链位置，资金安全托管，直至买卖双方均满意为止。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的专业人士','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业交易平台：浏览由文案撰稿人、设计师、开发人员和 SEO 专家提供的 10,000 多项现成服务，或者发布项目并让他们竞标。','Connector'=>'连接器','Connection'=>'连接','Publishing'=>'正在发布','Backups'=>'备份','Advanced'=>'高级','Check the connection now'=>'立即检查连接','Disconnect this site'=>'断开此站点的连接','This revokes the credential Zinn Digital® uses, so we can no longer publish to this site. Anything already published stays. Continue?'=>'这将撤销 Zinn Digital® 所使用的凭据，因此我们将无法再向此站点发布内容。已发布的任何内容都将保留。您要继续吗？','What we may do on this site'=>'我们可能在此网站上执行的操作','The credential we hold is an ordinary WordPress application password, so WordPress itself decides what is possible. These narrow it further, on your side.'=>'我们保存的凭据是一个普通的 WordPress 应用程序密码，因此由 WordPress 本身决定可以执行哪些操作。这些设置会在您这一端对其进行进一步限制。','Publish articles as'=>'将文章发布为','Choose “a draft” if you would rather read everything before it goes live.'=>'如果您想在发布前阅读所有内容，请选择“草稿”。','Published straight away'=>'立即发布','A draft, for me to review'=>'一份供我审阅的草稿','Pending review'=>'等待复审','Scheduled, using the date we send'=>'已计划，使用我们发送的日期','Show the author as'=>'将作者显示为','Which of your users appears as the author. This does not change who we sign in as.'=>'哪位用户显示为作者。这不会更改我们用于登录的身份。','Put articles in'=>'将文章放入','Allow images'=>'允许图像','Let Zinn Digital® upload images into this site’s media library'=>'允许 Zinn Digital® 上传图片至此站点的媒体库','Turn this off and articles arrive without their images. Nothing already uploaded is removed.'=>'关闭此选项，文章将不包含图片。已经上传的内容不会被删除。','Allow edits'=>'允许编辑','Let Zinn Digital® update an article it published before'=>'允许 Zinn Digital® 更新其之前发布的文章','Used for corrections and re-optimisation. It never touches anything you wrote yourself.'=>'用于更正与重新优化。绝不会改动您自己撰写的任何内容。','Tell me when something is published'=>'有内容发布时请通知我','Leave blank for no email. One message per article, from your own site.'=>'若不接收电子邮件，请留空。每篇文章一条消息，来自您自己的站点。','Off-site backups'=>'异地备份','This site sends its own backup straight to Zinn® storage. Nothing passes through our servers on the way.'=>'此站点将其自身的备份直接发送到 Zinn® 存储空间。在此过程中没有任何内容经过我们的服务器。','Back this site up to Zinn Digital®'=>'将此站点备份至 Zinn Digital®','Backup token'=>'备份令牌','Paste the token shown on this site’s Backups tab in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when you chose the plugin connection. It is shown there only once; saving the connection again issues a new one.'=>'请粘贴您选择插件连接时在 Zinn Digital® 仪表盘中此站点的“备份”选项卡上显示的令牌。它在那里仅显示一次；再次保存连接将生成一个新令牌。','Leave these out'=>'排除这些','One path per line, relative to wp-content — for example <code>cache</code> or <code>uploads/backups</code>. Caches and other backup plugins’ folders are the usual candidates.'=>'每行一个路径，相对于 wp-content — 例如 <code>cache</code> 或 <code>uploads/backups</code>。缓存和其他备份插件的文件夹通常是合适的对象。','Stop if the archive would exceed'=>'如果归档大小超过则停止','Megabytes. A shared host will usually kill a very large archive part-way; a bound turns that into a message instead of a silent failure.'=>'兆字节。共享主机通常会在中途终止非常大的归档文件；设置上限可将其转换为提示消息，而不是静默失败。','Detailed logging'=>'详细日志记录','Record what this plugin does, for support'=>'记录此插件的操作以供支持使用','Kept on this site, capped at the last 50 entries, and included in a diagnostics report. Turn it on before reproducing a problem.'=>'保留在此站点上，限制为最后 50 条条目，并包含在诊断报告中。在重现问题之前将其打开。','On uninstall'=>'卸载时','Delete this plugin’s settings when it is uninstalled'=>'卸载此插件时删除其设置','Uninstalling never revokes the application password — that is deliberate, so uninstalling to try something else does not break your publishing. Use Disconnect above if you want the credential gone.'=>'卸载操作绝不会撤销应用程序密码——这是刻意设计的，这样为了尝试其他工具而进行的卸载就不会中断您的发布。如果您希望彻底移除该凭据，请使用上方的“断开连接”。','The user we sign in as'=>'我们登录所用的用户','The site’s default category'=>'站点的默认分类','Connect this site again'=>'重新连接此站点','Connect this site'=>'连接此站点','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'打开您的 Zinn Digital® 仪表盘，转至 内容 → 其他站点，然后按“获取配对代码”。将其粘贴在下方。','Connecting again creates a fresh credential and leaves the old one in place — use Disconnect first if you want the old one gone.'=>'重新连接将创建新的凭据并保留旧凭据 — 如果您希望移除旧凭据，请先使用“断开连接”。','Pairing code'=>'配对代码','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'它会在您生成三十分钟后过期，并且只能使用一次。','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'您无权连接此站点。','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'此站点未连接到 Zinn Digital®。','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Get a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and paste it into this plugin’s settings.'=>'一切正常 — 只是尚未配对。请从您的 Zinn® 仪表盘获取配对代码，并将其粘贴到此插件的设置中。','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'打开我的 Zinn® 仪表盘','The connection is broken.'=>'连接已断开。','The WordPress user the credential belonged to (%s) no longer exists on this site, so nothing we send can be published. Connect again as a user who can publish.'=>'该凭据所属的 WordPress 用户（%s）已不再存在于此站点上，因此我们发送的任何内容都无法发布。请以具有发布权限的用户身份重新连接。','The “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password has been deleted from this site, so we can no longer sign in. Connect again to create a new one — nothing else was lost.'=>'“Zinn Digital® (publishing)”应用密码已从此站点中删除，因此我们无法再登录。请重新连接以创建新密码——没有丢失其他任何内容。','See this site’s application passwords'=>'查看此站点的应用程序密码','Connected, but publishing would fail.'=>'已连接，但发布将失败。','The credential belongs to %s, and that user can no longer publish posts. Sign-in still works, so nothing looks wrong until an article is due. Give that user the ability to publish, or connect again as somebody who can.'=>'该凭据属于 %s，且该用户无法再发布文章。登录功能仍可正常使用，因此在需要发布文章之前不会显示任何异常。请向该用户授予发布权限，或以拥有该权限的用户身份重新连接。','Edit that user'=>'编辑该用户','Connected here — we could not reach Zinn Digital® to confirm.'=>'已在此连接 — 我们无法联系 Zinn Digital® 进行确认。','Connected, but your Zinn® account needs attention.'=>'已连接，但您的 Zinn® 账户需要关注。','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'已连接到 Zinn Digital®。','Connected to Zinn Digital® as %s.'=>'已作为 %s 连接到 Zinn Digital®。','Publishing as'=>'发布身份：','Zinn® site ID'=>'Zinn® 站点 ID','This server could not reach api.zinndigital.com (%s). That is usually a firewall or an outbound-connection rule on your host, not a problem with your Zinn® account — publishing may still be working.'=>'此服务器无法连接到 api.zinndigital.com (%s)。这通常是您主机上的防火墙或出站连接规则导致的，而不是您的 Zinn® 账户问题——发布功能可能仍在正常运作。','Zinn Digital® answered with an error of its own — that is our end, not yours. Publishing is unaffected while this clears.'=>'Zinn Digital® 返回了其自身的错误 — 这是我们的问题，并非您的问题。在处理此问题期间，发布不受影响。','Your Zinn® account is not currently able to publish to this site. Your dashboard says why.'=>'您的 Zinn® 账户目前无法在此站点上发布内容。您的仪表盘中说明了原因。','Zinn Digital® answered HTTP %d, which we do not recognise. Send a diagnostics report from the Support tab and we will look — do not change anything here first.'=>'Zinn Digital® 返回了我们无法识别的 HTTP %d。请从“支持”标签页发送诊断报告，我们将进行查看 — 在此之前请勿更改此处的任何内容。','Check again now'=>'立即重新检查','Checked. The connection is live.'=>'已检查。连接已处于活跃状态。','We could not remove the application password, so this site is still connected. Delete “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” on your profile screen and try again — we have changed nothing.'=>'我们无法删除应用程序密码，因此该站点仍处于连接状态。请在您的个人资料屏幕上删除“Zinn Digital® (publishing)”，然后再试一次——我们没有做任何更改。','Disconnected. The application password has been revoked, so Zinn Digital® can no longer publish to this site. Nothing already published was touched.'=>'已断开连接。应用程序密码已被撤销，因此 Zinn Digital® 无法再发布内容到此站点。已发布的内容均未受到影响。','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'无法从此服务器读取该文件，因此未上传任何内容。','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'此站点无法流式传输上传内容，因此未发送任何内容。','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'该文件大小为 %1$s，且本站点的 PHP 未启用 cURL，因此可上传的最大大小为 %2$s。','The upload could not be completed.'=>'无法完成上传。','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'存储拒绝了上传 (HTTP %d)。','Style preset'=>'样式预设','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'一个起点。下方的任何内容都会覆盖它。','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'使用我自己的颜色和尺寸','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'保持此项关闭，预设将完全按原样使用。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'查看 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® 更新服务未为此更新提供下载链接。请检查此站点是否可以连接到 Zinn® 平台，然后重试。','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'无法从 Zinn® 更新服务 (%s) 下载更新。请在几分钟后重试。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'已下载的更新未通过完整性检查，未被安装。']];